---
// 图4：共享分叉——左：论文/V0 的 COW（共用尾块，写时整块复制）；右：V1 不可变满块+追加
---

<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 264" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">
      <text x="320" y="24" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74" text-anchor="middle">同一个 prompt 采样多个答案：前缀怎么共享</text>

      {/* ========== 左：论文/V0 COW ========== */}
      <text x="160" y="56" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">论文 / vLLM V0：引用计数 + 写时复制</text>
      {/* 共享 prompt 块 */}
      <rect x="40" y="72" width="62" height="30" rx="6" fill="#d9eef3" stroke="#0085a1"/>
      <text x="71" y="91" font-size="10" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">prompt 块0</text>
      <rect x="112" y="72" width="62" height="30" rx="6" fill="#d9eef3" stroke="#0085a1"/>
      <text x="143" y="91" font-size="10" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">prompt 块1</text>
      <rect x="184" y="72" width="62" height="30" rx="6" fill="#fdf0e0" stroke="#e6a23c" stroke-dasharray="4,3"/>
      <text x="215" y="88" font-size="9.5" fill="#b97a1f" text-anchor="middle">未满尾块</text>
      <text x="215" y="100" font-size="9.5" fill="#b97a1f" text-anchor="middle">refcnt=2</text>
      <text x="262" y="91" font-size="11" fill="#475569">← 两条序列共用</text>

      {/* 分叉 */}
      <path d="M215,106 L120,124" fill="none" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.3"/>
      <path d="M215,106 L250,124" fill="none" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.3"/>
      <rect x="60" y="128" width="120" height="28" rx="6" fill="#f7fbfc" stroke="#7ec3d8"/>
      <text x="120" y="146" font-size="9.5" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">序列1 继续写原块</text>
      <rect x="190" y="128" width="128" height="28" rx="6" fill="#fbe3e3" stroke="#e67e7e"/>
      <text x="254" y="146" font-size="9.5" fill="#b14a4a" text-anchor="middle">序列2 写 → 先整块复制再写</text>
      <text x="160" y="180" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">共享前缀读时共用；只有最后一个未满块可能被双写，</text>
      <text x="160" y="196" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">谁先写谁复制一份（fused copy kernel）</text>

      {/* 分隔线 */}
      <line x1="330" y1="48" x2="330" y2="216" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-dasharray="4,4"/>

      {/* ========== 右：V1 不可变块 ========== */}
      <text x="480" y="56" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">vLLM V1（今天）：满块不可变 + 追加</text>
      <rect x="356" y="72" width="62" height="30" rx="6" fill="#d9eef3" stroke="#0085a1"/>
      <text x="387" y="91" font-size="10" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">prompt 块0</text>
      <rect x="428" y="72" width="62" height="30" rx="6" fill="#d9eef3" stroke="#0085a1"/>
      <text x="459" y="91" font-size="10" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">prompt 块1</text>
      <rect x="500" y="72" width="62" height="30" rx="6" fill="#d9eef3" stroke="#0085a1"/>
      <text x="531" y="91" font-size="10" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">写满→锁定</text>
      <text x="586" y="91" font-size="10" fill="#475569">refcnt=2</text>

      <path d="M459,106 L410,124" fill="none" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.3"/>
      <path d="M459,106 L520,124" fill="none" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.3"/>
      <rect x="350" y="128" width="120" height="28" rx="6" fill="#e4f5ec" stroke="#0f9d68"/>
      <text x="410" y="146" font-size="9.5" fill="#0a7a50" text-anchor="middle">序列1 → 领新块 a</text>
      <rect x="480" y="128" width="120" height="28" rx="6" fill="#e4f5ec" stroke="#0f9d68"/>
      <text x="540" y="146" font-size="9.5" fill="#0a7a50" text-anchor="middle">序列2 → 领新块 b</text>
      <text x="480" y="180" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">块写满即不可变，结构上不可能写共享块——</text>
      <text x="480" y="196" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">不需要 COW，分歧天然只发生在各自的新块里</text>

      <line x1="40" y1="222" x2="600" y2="222" stroke="#e2e8f0"/>
      <text x="320" y="246" font-size="10.5" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">两种实现效果等价：完整前缀只存一份；区别只在「最后一个块」怎么处理</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
